  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that by image formula, image of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now equation&nbsp;of plane&nbsp; will be given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now from options, only point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;lies on it.</p>"
